Pre-requisites:
Make sure you have ubuntu wsl or gitbash. As of now I have Ubuntu WSL.

Steps:
1. Install docker and validate    //#docker version
      #For Apple Silicon #uname -m  //arm64
      #Download docker from official website https://docs.docker.com/desktop/setup/install/mac-install/?utm_source=chatgpt.com
      #cd ~/Downloads
      #sudo hdiutil attach Docker.dmg
      #sudo /Volumes/Docker/Docker.app/Contents/MacOS/install
      #sudo hdiutil detach /Volumes/Docker
      #open -a Docker //start a docker
      #docker desktop start
      #docker --version
2. Install kubectl      
      #brew install kubectl
      #kubectl version --client
3. Install kind   
      #brew install kind
      #kind version
4. Create a cluster               
      #kind create cluster
      #kind create cluster --name mycluster --config kind-config.yaml
5. Verify Cluster                //#kubectl cluster-info
6. List cluster                 //#kind get clusters
7. Delete cluster                //#kind delete cluster ,#kind delete clusters --all

Create Multi-Node cluster from kind config file:
---
kind: Cluster
apiVersion: kind.x-k8s.io/v1alpha4

nodes:
- role: control-plane
- role: worker
- role: worker
---
Verify the cluster details      //#kubectl get nodes  
